        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.17,
          "end": 96.393,
          "en": "not about the backend code itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.35,
          "end": 99.47999999999999,
          "en": "But then, in the app.js file on the backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.47999999999999,
          "end": 104.03999999999999,
          "en": "I have various routes, various API endpoints,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.03999999999999,
          "end": 105.93,
          "en": "to which you can send requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.93,
          "end": 109.95,
          "en": "in order to load data from that db.json file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.95,
          "end": 112.68,
          "en": "or in order to submit data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.68,
          "end": 116.97,
          "en": "And the application we're building here is a dummy app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.97,
          "end": 120.54,
          "en": "which users can use to share their opinions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.54,
          "end": 124.11,
          "en": "and to up or download opinions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.11,
          "end": 128.01,
          "en": "Because what could be better than an anonymous opinion site",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.01,
          "end": 130.11,
          "en": "on the internet, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.11,
          "end": 132.09,
          "en": "That's the demo app we're dealing with here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.09,
          "end": 134.31,
          "en": "And therefore, all these endpoints",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.31,
          "end": 138.603,
          "en": "are related to receiving or returning opinions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.19,
          "end": 143.01,
          "en": "And in order to bring up that backend server",
          "zh": ""
        },
